        "text": {
          "elements": [
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "The Zilliz Cloud update enhances the user experience by enabling comprehensive collection management directly through the Cloud UI. Users can now view, create, and delete collections with ease, along with viewing their schemas. Additionally, the ability to view indexes within the UI has been added. These features, coupled with improvements to the Cloud UI for smoother interaction, streamline database management and ensure a more intuitive user experience.",
